37087>>>>>    
37087>>>>>    Function IsLoggedIn Returns Boolean
37089>>>>>        String sLoginName
37089>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession bLoggedIn
37089>>>>>        
37089>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37090>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37092>>>>>            Forward Get IsLoggedIn to bLoggedIn
37094>>>>>            Function_Return bLoggedIn
37095>>>>>        End
37095>>>>>>
