37098>>>>>    
37098>>>>>    
37098>>>>>    //
37098>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37098>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37098>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37098>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37098>>>>>    //
37098>>>>>    // Params:
37098>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37098>>>>>    //
37098>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37100>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37100>>>>>        
37100>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37101>>>>>        
37101>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37101>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37103>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37104>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37105>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37106>>>>>            
37106>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37107>>>>>        End
37107>>>>>>
37107>>>>>        Else Begin
37108>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37109>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37110>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37111>>>>>            
37111>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37112>>>>>        End
37112>>>>>>
37112>>>>>    End_Procedure
37113>>>>>    
37113>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37115>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37115>>>>>    End_Procedure
37116>>>>>    
37116>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37118>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37118>>>>>    End_Procedure
37119>>>>>    
37119>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37121>>>>>        Integer iErr
37121>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37121>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37121>>>>>        
37121>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37122>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37123>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37125>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37127>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37128>>>>>        End
37128>>>>>>
37128>>>>>            
37128>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37128>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37129>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37130>>>>>        
37130>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37131>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37133>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37134>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37135>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37137>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37137>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37138>>>>>>
37138>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37139>>>>>            End
37139>>>>>>
37139>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37140>>>>>        End
37140>>>>>>
37140>>>>>    End_Procedure
37141>>>>>
37141>>>>>End_Class
